[gd_scene load_steps=18 format=3]

; Editor-owned Boardwalk creek and waterfront fidelity layer. The approved D2
; course remains in fairground_layout.tscn and the structural water/banks remain
; generated. These directly selectable pieces describe wet soil, erosion,
; planting and the controlled outfall without changing that artistic course.

